// Oriel: the system evdev rules plus symbols/oriel(remote), which remaps
// TV-remote keys WebKit does not know (it reports them as "Unidentified",
// keyCode 0) onto keysyms it does. This file shadows the system "evdev"
// rules through XKB_CONFIG_EXTRA_PATH. WPEPlatform builds its keymap from
// explicit names and ignores XKB_DEFAULT_OPTIONS, so the remap is applied
// for every model instead of behind an option.
! include %S/evdev

! model           = symbols
  *               = +oriel(remote)
